---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import TravelCTA from "../components/TravelCTA.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Hair Transplant in India | CareBridge Health"
  description="Affordable, high-quality hair transplant surgery in India with CareBridge Health. International patient coordination, JCI-accredited hospitals and transparent pricing."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900">
      Hair Transplant in India
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10">
      CareBridge Health helps international patients access safe, high-quality
      hair transplant surgery in India. We coordinate everything – from
      hospital selection and doctor appointments to travel, stay and
      post-procedure follow-ups.
    </p>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Why India for Hair Transplant?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>Experienced surgeons performing hundreds of procedures per year.</li>
        <li>Advanced techniques (FUE, DHI, FUT – depending on your case).</li>
        <li>Cost savings of up to 60–70% compared to US / UK / Gulf.</li>
        <li>English-speaking doctors and international patient departments.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Why CareBridge Health?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>
          We work only with carefully selected, accredited hospitals and clinics.
        </li>
        <li>
          Independent guidance – we help you compare options, not push one clinic.
        </li>
        <li>
          End-to-end coordination: reports, video consults, travel, hotel and local support.
        </li>
        <li>
          Transparent treatment plans and estimated total cost before you travel.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">How the Process Works</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>
          <strong>Initial enquiry:</strong> You share photos and basic medical history via
          WhatsApp or email.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Doctor review:</strong> Our partner surgeon reviews your case and suggests
          grafts needed and suitable techniques.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Treatment plan & budget:</strong> We send you a clear plan with
          tentative dates, hospital details and estimated cost.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Travel & stay:</strong> We help arrange airport pickup, hotel options and
          local transport.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Surgery & recovery:</strong> The procedure is done at a partner hospital /
          clinic, with follow-up checks before you return home.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>After-care:</strong> Online follow-ups with the doctor and support from
          CareBridge for prescriptions and clarifications.
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          How long do I need to stay in India?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Typically 5–7 days is enough for most hair transplant cases – including
          consultation, surgery and initial recovery checks. Complex cases may
          need a little longer.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Is the procedure painful?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          The surgery is usually done under local anaesthesia. You may feel
          mild discomfort, but most patients tolerate it well. Pain medicines
          are given for the first few days after the procedure.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          When will I see results?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Transplanted hair typically sheds in the first few weeks. New growth
          starts from 3–4 months and final results are usually visible around
          9–12 months.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 px-6 py-6 md:px-8 md:py-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">
          Want a personalised hair transplant quote?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Share your photos and basic details on WhatsApp. Our team will get a
          doctor review and send you an estimated graft count and cost
          breakdown.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          Chat with CareBridge on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <TravelCTA />
  </main>
</Layout>